- **Script check:** all part positions generated from one parameter set; cut list and fastener counts derived from it.
- **Recorded CAD check (arm thread, master torso 022da44, 2026-11-06 04:46Z):** Jetson, fans, Pi, IMU, PDB envelope and shelf clear the real RS03 and pitch bracket; four corner brackets moved (now 2020 type) after a 3 mm overlap was found; shelf plate is X A�55, Y 354.6 to 372.6; pitch bracket envelope X 78.4 to 113, Y 353.6 to 495, Z A�50, wing A�69 at Y 400 to 450.
