6. Anything in the shopping list that is wrong or missing for a build from the existing frame (one more 4-pack of 2020, 100 T-nuts, 100 M5 A- 10, 25 M5 A- 12, 25 M5 A- 16, 3 mm 6061 sheet, 4 A- 2020 brackets)?
