data/torso-stepped-README.md:49:The frame model is one merged body with 20 × 20 × 2 mm tube for each 2020, so joints are perfectly bonded. Real corner brackets and T-nuts are softer and can slip. Treat frame deflections as lower bounds, and use percentiles rather than the peaks, which sit at sharp corners. Frame material is 6063-T5, yield 145 MPa, assumed.
