data/torso-stepped-README.md:57:**Tip-over basis:** ground-level fall from standing, 40 kg (assumed), about 0.75 m centre-of-mass drop, 294 J. About 60% arrives at first contact, stopped over 40 mm of shell and link crush, with a peak of 1.5 × average. That gives about 6.6 kN, or 17 g. It scales inversely with crush distance, so 80 mm halves it.
