data/torso-stepped-README.md:152:The frame needs about 30 mm of stop at the side and 40 mm at the back. A side fall lands on the arm first, which stands more than 100 mm proud of the frame, so 30 mm is reachable there if the printed arm parts crush. The back has nothing proud of it, so it needs a pad. Bolted joints will slip or tear before these stresses matter, so treat 2020 and its T-nuts as parts to inspect after any fall.
